{
  "presets": [
    [
      "@babel/preset-env",
      {
        "bugfixes": true
      }
    ],
    ["@babel/preset-typescript"]
  ],
  **Expected Fields:**
- `sha` - string (40 char hex)
- `node_id` - string
- `url` - string (valid URL)
- `html_url` - string (valid URL)
- `commit` - object with author, committer, message, tree, verification
- `author` - user object or null
- `committer` - user object or null
- `parents` - array
  "plugins": [
    [
      "module-resolver",
      {
        "root": ["./src"],
        "alias": {
          "@": "./src"
        }
      }
    ]
  ]
}
